  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2494,
      "text": "[Imagine] how many towns of wrongdoers We have destroyed[6], and raised after them another people!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2495,
      "text": "When they sensed Our punishment, they started running away from it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2496,
      "text": "“Do not run away, but return to your luxuries and dwellings[7], perhaps you will be questioned.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2497,
      "text": "They said, “Woe to us! We were indeed wrongdoers.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2498,
      "text": "They kept crying this out loud until We mowed them down, lifeless[8].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2499,
      "text": "We did not create the heavens and earth and all that is between them for fun.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2500,
      "text": "If We had wished for a pastime[9], We could have had it from Our own, if We were to do so.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2501,
      "text": "Rather, We hurl the truth at falsehood, and it crushes it[10], so it vanishes. Woe to you for what you falsely ascribe [to Allah][11]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2502,
      "text": "To Him belongs all those who are in the heavens and earth. Those [angels] who are with Him are not too proud to worship Him, nor do they ever grow weary.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2503,
      "text": "They glorify Him day and night tirelessly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2504,
      "text": "Or have they taken gods from the earth who [cannot even] resurrect the dead?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2505,
      "text": "If there had been gods besides Allah in the heavens and earth, both realms would have fallen in disorder. Glory be to Allah – Lord of the Throne – far above what they ascribe [to Him].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2506,
      "text": "He cannot be questioned for what He does, but they will be questioned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 323,
      "ruku": 279,
      "hizbQuarter": 129,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2507,
      "text": "Or have they taken other gods besides Him? Say, “Bring your proof. Here is the Book of those who are with me, and the Book of those who came before me[12].” Yet most of them do not know the truth, so they turn away.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
